  <div class="two">
    <div>
      <p data-i18n="a1">I'm a Computer Science student at Arab Open University, focused on full-stack web development with the .NET ecosystem.</p>
      <p data-i18n="a2">I work with C#, object-oriented programming, SQL Server and ASP.NET Core, and I've also used C++, Python, Java, PHP, HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</p>
      <p data-i18n="a3">I enjoy problem solving and competitive programming, and I like building practical applications that solve real problems.</p>
      <p data-i18n="a4">I'm currently learning through the Digital Egypt Pioneers Initiative (DEPI) Full Stack .NET track.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="card"><strong>2027</strong><span data-i18n="s1">Expected graduation</span></div>
