<section id="projects"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="label"><b>06</b> <span data-i18n="l_proj">PROJECTS</span></p>
  <h2 data-i18n="h_proj">Featured Projects</h2>
  <div class="grid2">
    <article class="card wide"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p1g">Personal / freelance-style</span><h3 data-i18n="p1t">Nour Style E-Commerce</h3><p data-i18n="p1p">A bilingual fashion e-commerce concept designed to move a clothing business from social-media selling to a complete online shopping experience: Arabic / English interface, product catalog and categories, size and color filtering, cart, checkout flow, responsive design and an admin dashboard concept.</p><p class="note" data-i18n="p1n">Payment gateways are not integrated; checkout is a flow design.</p><ul class="chips"><li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>ASP.NET Core</li><li>SQL Server</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p2g">Freelance / practical</span><h3 data-i18n="p2t">Restaurant Website</h3><p data-i18n="p2p">A responsive website with restaurant information, menu, contact section and a mobile-friendly layout.</p><ul class="chips"><li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li><li>JavaScript</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p3g">C# / OOP training</span><h3 data-i18n="p3t">Student Management System</h3><p data-i18n="p3p">A console app practicing classes, constructors, lists, generic collections, input validation and basic CRUD operations.</p><ul class="chips"><li>C#</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p4g">C# / OOP training</span><h3 data-i18n="p4t">ATM Application</h3><p data-i18n="p4p">A menu-driven ATM simulation with balance check, deposit, withdrawal and input validation.</p><ul class="chips"><li>C#</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p5g">C# training</span><h3 data-i18n="p5t">Student Grades Application</h3><p data-i18n="p5p">A small app for managing student grades with classes, methods, constructors, lists and validation.</p><ul class="chips"><li>C#</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card wide"><span class="tag" data-i18n="p6g">Data analysis / academic</span><h3 data-i18n="p6t">Airline Data Analysis</h3><p data-i18n="p6p">An academic project on an airline dataset of about 98,619 records and 15 columns: exploring and cleaning data and looking for patterns.</p></article>
  </div>
  <p class="muted" data-i18n="p_note">Source code links will be added as each project is uploaded to GitHub. Next on my list: Task Management API, Library Management System and Inventory Management System (planned, not built yet).</p>
</div></section>

